Infernum.NightmareRoseIntroText: NIGHTMARE ROSE
PitySystem.UsesPity:
	'''
	[i:DestroyerTest/PityMarkBig] This item implements a pity system.
	[i:DestroyerTest/PityMarkBig] Opening the bag multiple times increases the chances of getting rare items from it, and increases the quantity of normal resource drops from it.
	[i:DestroyerTest/PityMarkBig] Successfully getting a rare drop will reset your pity.
	'''
ShieldPlayer.ShieldLine:
	'''
	[i:DestroyerTest/ShieldMarkBig] This item implements a special shield.
	[i:DestroyerTest/ShieldMarkBig] These Shields kill harmful projectiles inside their radius and do not protect from NPC contact damage.
	[i:DestroyerTest/ShieldMarkBig] Shields do not regenerate until they break, and pull from your health to regenerate.
	'''
ModName: HoleCat's Content Mod (Private Beta)

Extras: {
	ShadeWorldCommonBestiary: In addition to freeing the moon lord from imprisonment, breaking the seal also tore open holes across space, allowing enemies from the shade world to enter yours.
	ShadeWorldRareBestiary: All creatures of shade share some level of similarity to the creatures of your own world, as the shade world retains many such similarities. It is not known why mother darkness has created the shade world in this image.
	ShadeWorldEpicBestiary: Mother darkness is the giver of Dark Life. Though ever since she lost her beloved son, no amount of biodiversity and unique specimens has brought her enough joy to put a smile on her face.
}

